        "svgcontent": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1400\" height=\"1040\" viewBox=\"0 0 1400 1040\">\n <style>text{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;fill:#e6e7e1;font-size:16px} .muted{fill:#96998c;font-size:13px}.title{font-size:32px;font-weight:600}.rule{stroke:#34372d;stroke-width:1} .number{font-size:42px;fill:#ffb800} button{font:15px monospace;background:#171914;color:#e6e7e1;border:1px solid #6b705e;padding:12px 18px;min-height:48px;width:100%;cursor:pointer;border-radius:0}button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #ffb800;outline-offset:2px}button:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:default}p{font:14px monospace;color:#e6e7e1;margin:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}</style>\n <rect width=\"1400\" height=\"1040\" fill=\"#0b0c0a\"/>\n <text x=\"40\" y=\"58\" class=\"title\">Assembly cell</text><text x=\"40\" y=\"88\" class=\"muted\">Manufacturing / OT</text>\n <text id=\"ot-connection\" x=\"1000\" y=\"57\" fill=\"#ffb800\">Waiting for telemetry</text>\n <text id=\"ot-state\" x=\"1000\" y=\"88\" class=\"muted\">Disconnected</text><path d=\"M40 113H1360\" class=\"rule\"/>\n <text x=\"40\" y=\"149\" class=\"muted\">WORK ORDER</text><text id=\"ot-work_order\" x=\"40\" y=\"180\">--</text>\n <text x=\"1090\" y=\"149\" class=\"muted\">SIMULATION SECONDS</text><text id=\"ot-simulation_time\" x=\"1090\" y=\"181\">--</text>\n <rect x=\"40\" y=\"220\" width=\"920\" height=\"350\" fill=\"#11130f\" stroke=\"#34372d\"/>\n <text x=\"64\" y=\"252\">Carrier and assembly station</text><text x=\"64\" y=\"278\" class=\"muted\">Equipment feedback / one carrier per batch</text>\n <rect x=\"80\" y=\"419\" width=\"835\" height=\"65\" fill=\"#24271f\" stroke=\"#6b705e\"/>\n <path d=\"M105 450H889\" stroke=\"#6b705e\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"12 8\"/>\n <path d=\"M80 484V504M915 484V504M400 484V504M640 484V504\" stroke=\"#6b705e\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n <path d=\"M420 390V327H550V390\" stroke=\"#8a8e7e\" stroke-width=\"10\" fill=\"none\"/>\n <rect id=\"ot-clamp-shape\" x=\"453\" y=\"328\" width=\"64\" height=\"44\" fill=\"#34372d\" stroke=\"#8a8e7e\"/>\n <path id=\"ot-cycle-shape\" d=\"M485 377V407\" stroke=\"#34372d\" stroke-width=\"8\"/>\n <g id=\"ot-carrier\" transform=\"translate(0,0)\"><rect x=\"130\" y=\"393\" width=\"100\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#ffb800\" stroke=\"#ffb800\"/><path d=\"M148 399V432M173 399V432M198 399V432\" stroke=\"#0b0c0a\" stroke-width=\"5\"/></g>\n <circle id=\"ot-present-lamp\" cx=\"250\" cy=\"337\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#34372d\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"343\" class=\"muted\">Part present</text>\n <circle id=\"ot-positioned-lamp\" cx=\"683\" cy=\"337\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#34372d\"/><text x=\"703\" y=\"343\" class=\"muted\">In position</text>\n <text x=\"80\" y=\"539\" class=\"muted\">CONVEYOR</text><text id=\"ot-conveyor\" x=\"190\" y=\"539\">--</text>\n <text x=\"375\" y=\"539\" class=\"muted\">CLAMP</text><text id=\"ot-clamped\" x=\"445\" y=\"539\">--</text>\n <text x=\"663\" y=\"539\" class=\"muted\">CYCLE</text><text id=\"ot-cycle\" x=\"735\" y=\"539\">--</text>\n <rect x=\"1000\" y=\"220\" width=\"360\" height=\"150\" fill=\"#11130f\" stroke=\"#34372d\"/><text x=\"1024\" y=\"253\" class=\"muted\">PROCESSING SECONDS</text><text id=\"ot-progress\" x=\"1024\" y=\"315\" class=\"number\">--</text>\n <rect x=\"1000\" y=\"390\" width=\"360\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#11130f\" stroke=\"#34372d\"/><text x=\"1024\" y=\"424\" class=\"muted\">CURRENT BATCH RESULTS</text><text x=\"1024\" y=\"455\" class=\"muted\">GOOD</text><text x=\"1200\" y=\"455\" class=\"muted\">SCRAP</text><text id=\"ot-good_quantity\" x=\"1024\" y=\"515\" class=\"number\">--</text><text id=\"ot-scrap_quantity\" x=\"1200\" y=\"515\" class=\"number\">--</text>\n <text x=\"40\" y=\"620\">Operator controls</text><text id=\"ot-safety\" x=\"800\" y=\"620\" class=\"muted\">Guard: -- / Power: --</text>\n <foreignObject x=\"40\" y=\"643\" width=\"1320\" height=\"58\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"display:flex;gap:16px\"><button disabled=\"disabled\" id=\"ot-start\" style=\"width:190px;background:#ffb800;color:#0b0c0a\">Start</button><button disabled=\"disabled\" id=\"ot-stop\" style=\"width:190px\">Stop</button><button disabled=\"disabled\" id=\"ot-reset\" style=\"width:280px\">Acknowledge / reset fault</button><button disabled=\"disabled\" id=\"ot-retry\" style=\"width:200px\">Retry command</button><button disabled=\"disabled\" id=\"ot-discard\" style=\"width:200px\">Discard local retry</button></div></foreignObject>\n <foreignObject x=\"40\" y=\"714\" width=\"1320\" height=\"52\"><p xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" id=\"ot-command-status\">Waiting for a connection. Release a work order in Manufacturing, then Start the dispatched carrier.</p></foreignObject>\n <path d=\"M40 778H1360\" class=\"rule\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"814\">Fault diagnosis and recovery</text>\n <foreignObject x=\"40\" y=\"832\" width=\"1320\" height=\"42\"><p xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" id=\"ot-fault-reason\">No observation available</p></foreignObject>\n <foreignObject x=\"40\" y=\"879\" width=\"1320\" height=\"55\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"display:flex;gap:16px\"><button disabled=\"disabled\" id=\"ot-conveyor_jam\" style=\"width:310px\">Inject conveyor jam</button><button disabled=\"disabled\" id=\"ot-sensor_failure\" style=\"width:310px\">Fail position sensor</button><button disabled=\"disabled\" id=\"ot-guard_open\" style=\"width:310px\">Open guard</button><button disabled=\"disabled\" id=\"ot-power_loss\" style=\"width:310px\">Remove power</button></div></foreignObject>\n <text x=\"40\" y=\"961\" class=\"muted\">Restore the condition, acknowledge the fault, then Start. Faults preserve the active batch.</text>\n <text id=\"ot-scope\" x=\"40\" y=\"1000\" class=\"muted\">Run / epoch: --</text>\n</svg>\n",
